      "area": "General",
      "position": 2,
      "content": "Additional Degree Information",
      "contentHtml": null
    },
    {
      "id": "7dcb6f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
      "type": "GeneralText",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 3,
      "content": "The Criminology and Justice Studies, B.A. is ALSO offered through Extended Learning . Please see the 25-26 Catalog for more information.",
      "contentHtml": "<p><strong><em>The Criminology and Justice Studies, B.A. is ALSO offered through </em></strong><a href=\"https://www.csusm.edu/el/programs/index.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><em>Extended Learning</em></strong></a>.</p><p><br></p><p>Please see the <a href=\"https://catalog.csusm.edu/preview_program.php?catoid=11&amp;poid=2566&amp;returnto=1994\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">25-26 Catalog</a> for more information.</p>"
    }
